WEBVTT

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:07.860
<i>Seiichi's party has arrived at Barbador 
Magic Academy with great excitement.</i>

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:10.760
<i>Seiichi and Artoria joined as teachers</i>

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:13.010
<i>while Saria and Lulune joined as students,</i>

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>and Oliga joined as Seiichi's assistant.</i>

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:22.160
<i>Seiichi was tasked with saving the academy,</i>

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:28.460
<i>and to that end, he was assigned to 
take on Beatrice's class, Class F.</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:45.640
<i>They were all incredibly unique students.</i>

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:51.610
<i>Will Seiichi be able to guide them properly?</i>

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:54.840
<i>What fate lies in stores for Seiichi?</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:10.250
I-It's nice to m—

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:13.370
Who the hell are you, huh?!

00:01:13.370 --> 00:01:15.340
Y-You're too close.

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:19.470
What're you starin' at? You wanna go, huh?

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:21.560
Huh?!

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:23.970
<i>Maybe I can't do this!</i>

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:31.730
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:31.730
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:31.730
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:31.730
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:31.730
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:58.750
Don't you go ignoring me! 
You screwing with me?!

00:02:56.170 --> 00:03:01.070
<b>Being a Teacher Is Tough!</b>

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:01.070
Agnos-kun.

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:10.890
Boss Lady Beatrice!

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:18.420
That had to hurt.

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:22.340
Boss Lady, not the corner!

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:24.940
Please stop calling me that.

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:26.850
Besides, the one you were 
picking a fight with

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:29.230
is the new teacher in charge of you all.

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:31.520
Wh-What?!

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:34.440
He's our new teacher?!

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:37.110
Nice to meet you.

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:38.900
Why is a brat like him—

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:42.360
Brat! Brat!

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:44.780
How many revolutions is he going for?!

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:48.660
<b>10 Points</b>

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:50.030
Silence.

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:59.640
As I've said, this is Seiichi-sensei, 
the teacher who will be taking over for me,

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:01.540
and his assistant, Oliga-san.

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:07.180
Huh? There's only four?

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:09.350
Class F has four students.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:14.790
Uh, it's nice to meet you. I'm Hiiragi Seiichi.

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:17.680
I'm roughly the same age as all of you here,

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:20.870
but I'll be teaching you everything I can.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:23.740
I-I hope we can get along.

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:25.010
I'm Oliga.

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:26.660
Nice to meet you.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:28.660
<b>C-Cat Ears ♥</b>

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:34.480
And this is Saria-san, who will 
be joining Class F starting today.

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:35.640
I'm Saria!

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:37.580
I hope we can all be friends!

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:41.240
What? What's all this?!

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:44.370
Oh, man, you're seriously cute!

00:04:44.370 --> 00:04:47.290
My heart's locked on to your eyes!

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.910
<b>That was dated!!</b>

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:50.890
Wanna hit up a coffee 
joint with me after this?!

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:51.350
<b>Who is this guy?!</b>

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:53.610
You there, be quiet!

00:04:53.610 --> 00:04:56.520
Now, please introduce yourselves.

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:59.780
Okay! I'll go first, then!

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:01.610
Name's Agnos Passion!

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:04.570
I'm 999-and-0 for fights won!

00:05:04.810 --> 00:05:09.190
The nickname I've earned is 
"The Terrifying Pompadour of Hell"!

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:08.930
<b>Terrifying Pompadour of Hell</b>

00:05:09.190 --> 00:05:11.740
Remember all that!

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:13.310
Amazing!

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:14.840
R-Really?

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:16.120
I'll go, too!

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:19.040
I'm Gorilla Saria!

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:19.040
<b>Gorilla Saria</b>

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:19.040
<b>Gorilla Saria</b>

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:27.020
Th-That was magic! Just magic!

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:28.370
Exit stage left.

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:30.760
<b>I'm shocked!</b>

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:33.680
Okay, next.

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:38.480
I'm Brud Lev Kaiser.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.230
Kaiser?

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:41.900
You figured it out, eh?

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:46.420
As you surmised, I am a 
prince of the Kaiser Empire.

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:47.610
<b>Wise Prince</b>

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:51.910
Though my status is irrelevant 
here at this academy.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:54.300
Don't you go ignoring me!

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:55.970
I thought you were knocked out.

00:05:55.970 --> 00:05:57.570
I was just sleeping!

00:05:57.570 --> 00:06:00.300
Please remember that even though 
I'm in the same class as him,

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:01.740
I'm not on the same level.

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:04.760
Huh?! What'd you just say?!

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:06.340
Let's take it outside!

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:08.510
I wouldn't mind that.

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:10.840
C-Come on, you two.

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:16.310
Agnos-kun, Brud-kun.

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:21.150
Uh, next is...

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:35.080
You've got nothing to say?!

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:37.300
Helen Rosa.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.920
Wait, that's it?

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:43.750
<b>Twin Crimson Blades</b>

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:43.750
<b>Twin Crimson Blades</b>

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:45.720
I knew there was more.

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:48.550
Uh, last is...

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:57.890
<b>Quiet Beast</b>

00:06:57.890 --> 00:07:00.060
Wh-What?

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:02.420
<b>Baird Lutra</b>

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:05.240
<b>Nice to meet you!</b>

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:07.530
Wait, you can't talk?!

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:09.090
So cute!

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:10.530
<b></b>Nice to meet you!

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:12.990
Nope!

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:16.160
No way! There's no way I can lead this class!

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:17.700
Too bad!

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:27.340
<b>Kannazuki Karen</b>

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:29.230
Where is he?

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:32.930
That way?!

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:35.350
Wait for me, Seiichi-kun!

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:41.440
Sorry!

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:43.230
Ow...

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:46.820
Y-You're Seto Airi.

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:49.220
Oh, Student Council President.

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:51.490
What's the matter? Why the rush?

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:52.940
Oh, nothing.

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:55.240
I just caught a nostalgic smell.

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:57.490
Huh? Do you mean...

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:59.620
Yeah, I'm sure of it!

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:01.410
It's Seiichi-kun's smell!

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:04.980
Really?! So we can finally see Sei-chan!

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:06.910
I'll look for him, too!

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:15.100
<i>Seiichi-kun...</i>

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:24.600
Now, I'd like to return 
your last herbalism test.

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:26.230
Bring it on!

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:31.500
I haven't done anything 
and I'm already exhausted.

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:33.610
Onii-chan, hang in there.

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:35.460
Agnos-kun, 0.

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:37.380
Why?!

00:08:37.380 --> 00:08:39.080
What do you mean, "why"?!

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:41.330
You answered "With Spirit" 
for every question!

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:41.330
<i>Spirit! Spirit! Spirit!</i>

00:08:41.590 --> 00:08:44.790
But you can do anything 
if you've got enough spirit!

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:48.080
Next is Brud-kun.

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:48.810
Hmph.

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:51.630
Wonderful. 90.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.130
Wow, amazing.

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:54.970
This much is to be expected.

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.510
Baird-kun.

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:03.180
95. You did very well.

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:04.520
Huh?!

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:06.810
How many times do I have to tell you?!

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:07.880
These are mushrooms!

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:10.670
I told you to find medicinal herbs! Herbs!

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:14.780
<i>So he's smart, despite his looks?</i>

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:19.140
Why did you get a good 
grade while I got a 0?!

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:20.550
I can't accept this!

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:24.790
Hmph. Obviously it's because 
your answers were inappropriate.

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:27.350
What's that?! Let's take it outside!

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:28.920
<b>I'll send you packing!!</b>

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:28.920
I wouldn't mind that.

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.040
Oh, then let's go throw down!

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.840
H-Hey, not again!

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:30.490
Come with me!

00:09:30.490 --> 00:09:31.630
Bring it, Pompadour.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.580
<i>Just how scary is Beatrice-san?</i>

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:40.690
Helen scored 100.

00:09:40.690 --> 00:09:41.970
Impressive as usual.

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:43.850
It's nothing.

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:46.770
Wow, you're all so smart!

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:51.020
Saria!

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:53.480
Uh, i-it's magic.

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:59.400
Sensei... Is it possible 
to transform using magic?

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:01.730
So it would appear.

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:04.840
Please, Saria.

00:10:04.840 --> 00:10:08.370
The others aren't used to you yet, 
so please stop turning into a gorilla.

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:09.580
Okay!

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:11.790
D-Do you really understand?

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:17.980
Boobs—

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:21.140
Um, Seiichi-sensei.

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:22.800
Y-Yes?

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:28.770
How about you observe the practical 
abilities of these four as a special lesson?

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:34.480
Practical abilities? 
You mean real combat training?

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:35.650
Yes.

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:39.190
I think it would be best for you to 
understand each student's strengths

00:10:39.190 --> 00:10:43.430
in order to guide them moving forward.

00:10:43.430 --> 00:10:45.190
That's certainly true.

00:10:45.510 --> 00:10:46.790
Very well.

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:49.740
A special lesson, huh?

00:10:49.740 --> 00:10:53.730
RUUUMBLE

00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:57.010
<b>But first, commercials.</b>

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:04.850
Anyway,

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:07.770
just who is this Seiichi bastard?

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:10.300
I haven't the slightest idea.

00:11:10.300 --> 00:11:11.690
What do you think?

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:15.360
<b>Mystery</b>

00:11:13.910 --> 00:11:14.940
So are you.

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:19.200
Hey, you seem to be friendly 
with that teacher.

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:20.180
You know each other?

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:21.530
We do.

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:24.620
Just what are you to him?

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:27.660
Me? I'm Seiichi's wife!

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:30.950
Oh, his wife, huh?

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:33.700
What?!

00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:36.460
Th-Then what about that Oliga girl?

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:38.890
She's Seiichi's little sister.

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:40.690
I-I see.

00:11:40.690 --> 00:11:43.050
You three came to this academy together?

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:47.010
No, we also came with Seiichi's 
girlfriend and servant.

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:48.970
Time to dig in!

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:50.290
What?!

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:51.470
Girlfriend?!

00:11:51.470 --> 00:11:52.770
Servant?!

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:54.310
<b>Seriously?!</b>

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:57.830
Yeah! We all love Seiichi!

00:11:57.830 --> 00:12:01.110
Damn him!

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:04.220
I'll kill him!

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:06.050
What got into him?

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:10.060
Hey, you're that teacher's wife, right?

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:11.870
Yeah, that's right!

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:15.290
Then tell us. Is he strong?

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:17.350
He's super strong!

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:19.320
I see.

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:28.680
Well, Seiichi-kun?

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:31.730
What's your impression 
of the Class F students?

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:36.950
Well, they're all very unique, 
but not so much problem children.

00:12:36.950 --> 00:12:38.790
I'm a little relieved.

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:40.320
They're all funny.

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:41.940
I see.

00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:48.240
However, Class F is just a bit 
different from the other classes.

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:52.370
Different how?

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:58.540
Have you heard what the rest 
of the academy calls them?

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:01.250
No. I only arrived here recently.

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:03.050
The Dropout Corps.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:04.090
Huh?

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:06.140
The truth is...

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:09.750
They're dealing with a major problem.

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:16.980
All right, let's do this!

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:18.590
It's just us here?

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:20.310
That's all the better, isn't it?

00:13:22.060 --> 00:13:24.740
My bat's gonna bring the fire!

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:27.080
Let's show him what we're made of.

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:30.910
Well, well, what are the dropouts doing here?

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:35.790
What'd you say?!

00:13:36.020 --> 00:13:40.170
You plebeians shouldn't stand 
on the same ground as me.

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:41.520
Or...

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:46.170
Are you suggesting that I ought to 
breathe the same air as you fools?

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:48.300
B-Brother...

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:50.810
My foolish younger brother, Brud...

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:53.910
This class is perfect for a failure like you.

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:55.860
You keep shootin' off that mouth,

00:13:55.860 --> 00:13:59.480
so you must be prepared for the 
consequences, right? Huh, huh, huh?!

00:13:58.660 --> 00:13:59.480
S-Space!

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:01.230
Stop it, Agnos!

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:04.320
How do you expect me to stay quiet 
when he's insulting us like this?!

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:05.780
I'll kill you!

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:07.640
What the hell are you doing?!

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:09.240
Let me go, damn it!

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:11.790
Amusing.

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:14.840
Then let me show you the difference 
between Class S and you dropouts.

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:18.760
Class S?

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:21.710
Yes. The top class in this academy.

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:27.970
Any who defy me, Theobald Tera Kaiser, 
the next Emperor of the Kaiser Empire,

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:30.420
will be crushed.

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:37.230
Oh? You had such a beauty with you?

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:38.390
Huh?

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:41.060
What is your name?

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:42.810
Me? I'm Saria!

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:44.630
Rejoice, Saria.

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:48.240
I hereby make you my woman.

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:49.300
Oh?

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:53.170
I'm sorry! I'm already in love with Seiichi!

00:14:57.070 --> 00:15:01.490
Did I mishear? 
Are you rejecting my invitation?

00:15:01.490 --> 00:15:02.540
Yeah, can't do it!

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:05.170
I love Seiichi!

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:09.930
I-Impossible!

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:12.590
There's no man better than me...

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:16.250
Seiichi is way cooler than you!

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:18.520
He's also very strong!

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:21.100
How dare you?!

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:28.390
Why are you laughing?!

00:15:28.390 --> 00:15:31.450
You dare mock the next 
Emperor of the Kaiser Empire,

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:33.820
and you think you can get away with it?!

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:40.460
Saria, I shall grant you one 
more chance. Become my—

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:41.290
Can't!

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:56.970
I'll let you off...

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:58.800
for today.

00:15:58.800 --> 00:16:00.640
You running away?!

00:16:01.550 --> 00:16:03.130
Don't push your luck.

00:16:03.130 --> 00:16:07.310
I've just decided to bury you all 
in the upcoming class competition.

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:09.370
Class competition?!

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:11.750
Do look forward to it.

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:14.080
Brother...

00:16:15.270 --> 00:16:17.100
How long are you gonna keep holding me?!

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:18.890
Let me down already!

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:24.620
Seiichi!

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:27.790
Oh, there you are.

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:29.970
Sorry I'm late!

00:16:29.970 --> 00:16:33.050
<i>Seiichi?! So he's...</i>

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:35.100
Hey! You're late!

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:36.520
Well, Barna-san's...

00:16:36.520 --> 00:16:39.690
Er, the headmaster just 
kept ad-libbing on and on.

00:16:41.070 --> 00:16:43.310
I wound up really late.

00:16:45.390 --> 00:16:46.220
Huh?

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:48.520
Did something happen?

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:51.010
Nothing in particular.

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:53.820
Would you start our special lesson already?

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:55.510
R-Right.

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:04.870
All right, then, could you 
all show me your skills?

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:07.650
I'll leave the rest to you, Sensei.

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:08.770
Understood.

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:14.060
Oh, I won't use magic, so don't worry.

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:18.390
Then your first opponent will be—

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:19.720
Me.

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:20.930
Hey, Helen!

00:17:21.150 --> 00:17:24.030
You back... off... and...

00:17:24.030 --> 00:17:28.580
And go on ahead. 
I'm so cool, letting you go first!

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:36.700
S-Sounds good.

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:40.880
You won't use magic? 
Are you underestimating us?

00:17:40.880 --> 00:17:43.750
Huh? No, it's not like that.

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:47.120
We're the ones assessing <i>your</i> abilities.

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:54.010
In that case...

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:59.710
Let's find out...

00:17:59.710 --> 00:18:01.430
if your strength is the real deal!

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:18.310
Th-That's incredible intensity.

00:18:18.310 --> 00:18:20.870
But why is she so mad at me?!

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:24.340
What did I do?!

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:29.820
Helen attacks Seiichi with incredible hatred.

00:18:29.820 --> 00:18:33.750
What is going to happen to Seiichi?

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:39.020
And what is this major problem 
the students of Class F have?!

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:49.190
Say, care for a match?

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:53.690
Shall we see who can kill more 
students of Barbador Magic Academy?

00:18:53.690 --> 00:18:55.000
Sounds great.

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:57.110
It's been a while, too,

00:18:57.480 --> 00:19:00.530
since I last saw your strength 
as the "Murder Princess."

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:03.780
I, too, look forward to enjoying

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:06.450
your power of "Deliverance."

00:19:06.850 --> 00:19:08.750
But what a shame.

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:11.220
I doubt you'll have a chance to do anything.

00:19:11.220 --> 00:19:16.630
I'll take care of all the brats at 
Barbador Magic Academy with my magic.

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:20.260
Hey, now, it won't go that easily.

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:23.400
They have lots of mages in there.

00:19:23.400 --> 00:19:27.340
That old man known as 
the Holy Mage, Barnabus...

00:19:27.340 --> 00:19:29.560
You shouldn't take him lightly.

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:33.180
Oh, my! There's an old man like that there?

00:19:33.180 --> 00:19:35.860
Now my heart is racing with excitement.

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:39.280
I wonder what kind of terror 
and despair he'll show me.

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:41.450
It's thrilling, isn't it?

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:44.920
I'm sure the Great Devil will be delighted.

00:21:25.400 --> 00:21:26.850
Greetings, everyone.

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:29.110
Now, time for the main story to begin!

00:21:29.110 --> 00:21:32.370
In this segment, I, Guscle, 
the Master of the Adventurer's Guild...

00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:37.640
And I, Eris, will provide you with even 
more information to enjoy the story.

00:21:37.640 --> 00:21:38.600
We call it...

00:21:38.600 --> 00:21:42.780
"A Lecture on International Relations
That Even a Meathead Can Understand!"

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:44.310
Muscle!

00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:50.490
First up is Barbador.

00:21:48.830 --> 00:22:04.150
<b>Barbador Magic Academy</b>

00:21:50.490 --> 00:21:52.140
Bam!

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:55.940
As the name suggests, this is where 
Barbador Magic Academy is located.

00:21:55.940 --> 00:21:56.900
Barbador!

00:21:56.900 --> 00:21:59.930
This a neutral region that armed 
forces aren't allowed to enter.

00:21:59.930 --> 00:22:01.560
Barbador!

00:22:01.940 --> 00:22:03.890
Peace!

00:22:05.070 --> 00:22:19.580
<b>Wimberg Kingdom</b>

00:22:05.430 --> 00:22:07.480
Next is the Wimberg Kingdom.

00:22:08.370 --> 00:22:11.980
As you know, this is the land Seiichi-san 
resided in during the last season,

00:22:11.980 --> 00:22:14.450
and it's the nation with 
our Adventurer's Guild.

00:22:14.450 --> 00:22:16.280
That takes me back, Seiichi!

00:22:16.280 --> 00:22:18.810
Saria! Let's arm wrestle again!

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:20.220
Armuscle!

00:22:20.580 --> 00:22:37.560
<b>Demon Kingdom</b>

00:22:20.780 --> 00:22:22.620
Next is the Demon Kingdom.

00:22:22.620 --> 00:22:25.070
This is the nation governed by 
the Demon Lord's daughter, Lutia...

00:22:25.070 --> 00:22:26.590
Oh, Lutia!

00:22:26.590 --> 00:22:29.530
And while it seems to want an 
alliance with the Wimberg Kingdom,

00:22:27.510 --> 00:22:29.530
Lutia!

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:32.710
it's worth being cautious of 
how they'll act in the future.

00:22:30.260 --> 00:22:32.260
Lutia!

00:22:32.710 --> 00:22:34.380
Be cautious!

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:52.030
<b>Kaiser Empire</b>

00:22:38.840 --> 00:22:40.540
Next is the Kaiser Empire.

00:22:40.540 --> 00:22:41.650
Kaiser!

00:22:41.650 --> 00:22:44.330
This is an aggressive nation 
plotting world domination.

00:22:42.460 --> 00:22:44.330
Kaiser!

00:22:44.330 --> 00:22:47.850
The hero candidates they summoned 
were sent to Barbador Magic Academy

00:22:45.100 --> 00:22:47.090
Kaiser!

00:22:47.850 --> 00:22:49.890
as part of a plot by its advisor, Helio.

00:22:49.890 --> 00:22:52.280
Dangerous!

00:22:53.510 --> 00:23:07.840
<b>Valsha Empire</b>

00:22:53.800 --> 00:22:56.370
And next is the Valsha Empire.

00:22:56.370 --> 00:22:59.290
Valsha, Valsha...

00:22:57.690 --> 00:23:00.140
It's a nation ruled by an empress.

00:22:59.290 --> 00:23:02.870
Valsha, Valsha, Valsha!

00:23:00.140 --> 00:23:03.770
They're currently fending off an 
invasion from the Kaiser Empire.

00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:04.830
Valsha...

00:23:04.830 --> 00:23:06.350
It's all right, Guscle.

00:23:06.350 --> 00:23:07.970
Muscle!

00:23:08.510 --> 00:23:10.770
Finally, we have the Great Devil Order.

00:23:10.770 --> 00:23:13.480
They're a secret cult acting in the 
shadows to resurrect the Great Devil.

00:23:13.480 --> 00:23:16.280
One of their leaders, Kreis, 
works in the Demon Kingdom.

00:23:16.280 --> 00:23:19.340
They're a bunch of villains trying 
to plunge the world into chaos!

00:23:19.340 --> 00:23:21.340
That was my line!

00:23:21.340 --> 00:23:22.440
Ouch!

00:23:22.270 --> 00:23:24.980
<b>Valsha Empire</b>

00:23:22.270 --> 00:23:24.980
<b>Wimberg Kingdom</b>

00:23:22.270 --> 00:23:28.940
<b>Invading</b>

00:23:22.270 --> 00:23:28.940
<b>Kaiser Empire</b>

00:23:22.270 --> 00:23:28.940
<b>Demon Kingdom</b>

00:23:22.270 --> 00:23:29.170
<b>Barbador Magic Academy</b>

00:23:22.270 --> 00:23:29.170
<b>Neutral</b>

00:23:22.270 --> 00:23:29.170
<b>Alliance</b>

00:23:25.130 --> 00:23:29.150
Keep an eye on how these nations 
react to one another in the future.

00:23:29.150 --> 00:23:31.780
Three! Two! One!

00:23:31.780 --> 00:23:33.530
Muscle, muscle!

00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>To be continued</b>

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:39.430
Hey! What is with this 
young delinquent blonde girl?!

00:23:39.430 --> 00:23:41.560
She suddenly tried to slice into her teacher!

00:23:41.560 --> 00:23:43.980
Calm down, you fool!

00:23:43.560 --> 00:23:46.230
<b>Next Time
Seiichi vs. Class F</b>

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:45.850
Next time, "Seiichi vs. Class F."

00:23:45.850 --> 00:23:47.970
None of you are rotten oranges!
